strengths.value:
1. The structure of the paper is well-organized and the content is clearly presented;
2. The effectiveness of the dataset is demonstrated through its application to various downstream tasks, including various 2D and 3D tasks.
3. This paper introduces a novel 360-degree real car dataset. Previous literature has not extensively covered. Both the quality and the diversity of the dataset are commendable.

